  "stimulus": null,
  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A right triangle has legs with lengths of <math alttext=\"28\"><mn>28</mn>\n</math> centimeters and <math alttext=\"20\"><mn>20</mn>\n</math> centimeters. What is the length of this triangle's hypotenuse, in centimeters?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [
    {
      "id": "86de8edd-fec5-4378-99a6-9f649020b648",
      "content": "<p><math alttext=\"8 StartRoot 6 EndRoot\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t<msqrt>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t</msqrt>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"
